OL,3,AAid worker in Nepal says hope remains
OL,4,Aof finding survivors as more than 480
OL,5,Akilled by flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll in Nepal has risen to
OL,8,F489, officials say, more than 48 hours
OL,9,Fafter flash flooding devastated the
OL,10,FHimalayan border region
OL,12,FAn aid worker tells the BBC the
OL,13,Fsituation in Nepal is "chaos", but he
OL,14,Fbelieves there is hope that those still
OL,15,Fmissing "could be found alive"
OL,17,FThe Nepali government has released the
OL,18,Fnames of 500 missing foreign nationals,
OL,19,Fincluding 178 from India, 65 from the
OL,20,FUS and 33 from the UK
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
