OL,3,AAid worker in Nepal says hope remains
OL,4,Aof finding survivors as more than 480
OL,5,Akilled by flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, five people have died and
OL,8,Fmore than 558 are missing, Chinese
OL,9,Fstate media say. It is not clear if the
OL,10,Flatest figures overlap
OL,12,FMeanwhile, Chinese authorities have
OL,13,Fresumed rescue efforts near the
OL,14,FNepal-Tibet border, state media says,
OL,15,Fafter fears that a newly formed lake of
OL,16,Frising water could burst its banks
OL,17,Fhalted operations
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
